{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Hey Gina, hope you're doing great! Still working on my biz. Took a short trip last week to Rome to clear my mind a little."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-2714872be71b12f875619677", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:38.759897+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2714872be71b12f875619677", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2714872be71b12f875619677", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Hi! Good for you! It definitely will help you to concentrate on your biz better."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-a1c92e79f15b6fc6911ed448", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:38.791742+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a1c92e79f15b6fc6911ed448", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a1c92e79f15b6fc6911ed448", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks, Gina. Still working on opening a dance studio."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-5a417a1f4d728a364dcefd8b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:38.809245+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5a417a1f4d728a364dcefd8b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5a417a1f4d728a364dcefd8b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: When are you opening the studio?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-ed8ea82466137e8a96657934", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:38.832442+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ed8ea82466137e8a96657934", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ed8ea82466137e8a96657934", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: The official opening night is tomorrow. I'm working hard to make everything just right. Can't wait to see it all come together!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-c1ae3f98a3bfa5acc7cb4208", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:38.846901+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c1ae3f98a3bfa5acc7cb4208", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c1ae3f98a3bfa5acc7cb4208", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Congrats, Jon! The studio looks amazing. You've put a lot of work into this and I'm so pumped for the launch tomorrow. Don't miss a beat!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-9cbf21b9b0d3520430797b60", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:38.864054+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9cbf21b9b0d3520430797b60", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9cbf21b9b0d3520430797b60", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks, Gina! I'm excited! It's been a wild ride, but I'm feeling good and ready to give it my best."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-93679e2db49e654576c59e19", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:38.888086+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "93679e2db49e654576c59e19", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "93679e2db49e654576c59e19", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Wow, Jon, you must be so excited! You've come so far since we last talked, and tomorrow's gonna be a blast! All those long nights were worth it - so take some time to savor it. Capture the joy and thrill that dance brings - it's magical!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-f75613b8d3444e4f0a5778a0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:38.906074+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f75613b8d3444e4f0a5778a0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f75613b8d3444e4f0a5778a0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Tomorrow's gonna be an awesome night and I'm not gonna forget a second of it. I put so much into this and I want to savor all the good vibes. Thanks for always having my back. You're the best!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-77543e50899edd3eb5f9f75d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:38.933795+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "77543e50899edd3eb5f9f75d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "77543e50899edd3eb5f9f75d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: I'm always proud of you. Enjoy the good feels tomorrow, you earned it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-7e3b5820dae7defa2cc2afba", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:38.950076+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7e3b5820dae7defa2cc2afba", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7e3b5820dae7defa2cc2afba", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! Your pride and support mean a lot. Looking forward to enjoying the moment with you."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-771ec5a8cf45b9939da5c4d9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:38.965293+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "771ec5a8cf45b9939da5c4d9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "771ec5a8cf45b9939da5c4d9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: I'll be right by your side, Jon. Let's live it up and make some great memories tomorrow. So excited!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-1eed19fa8f2268165803249b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:38.980915+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1eed19fa8f2268165803249b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1eed19fa8f2268165803249b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Yeah! Let's make some awesome memories tomorrow at the grand opening!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-84283f715cc449677a600467", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:38.998858+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "84283f715cc449677a600467", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "84283f715cc449677a600467", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Can't wait to make more memories at your dance studio!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-a9e18a3ce8d28b876adf0e43", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:39.014149+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a9e18a3ce8d28b876adf0e43", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a9e18a3ce8d28b876adf0e43", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Looking forward to more cool memories!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-30/session_15-fa7a9869ec2d6d0ee4da2247", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:09:39.028972+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fa7a9869ec2d6d0ee4da2247", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fa7a9869ec2d6d0ee4da2247", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
